Le secont LLM que j'ai utilisé est Claude Sonnet 5.5 Moyen, je lui ai également donné SPEC.md et voici la première version:

Listen to Tommy
Listen to Gina
Listen to Vince
Cast Tommy
Cast Gina
Cast Vince

Put Gina times Gina into Delta
Put Tommy times Vince into Sue
Put Sue times 4 into Sue
Put Delta minus Sue into Delta
Put Tommy times 2 into Twoa
Put 0 minus Gina into Negb

If Tommy is 0
Say "a vaut 0 : ce n'est pas une equation du second degre"

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is 0
Put Negb over Twoa into Root
Say Root

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is less than 0
Say "Delta negatif : pas de solution reelle"

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is greater than 0
Put Delta into Guess
Put 0 into Count
While Count is less than 40
Put Delta over Guess into Quot
Put Guess plus Quot into Guess
Put Guess over 2 into Guess
Build Count up

Put Negb plus Guess into Top
Put Top over Twoa into First
Put Negb minus Guess into Top
Put Top over Twoa into Second
Say First
Say Second




Il y avait quelques bugs, je lui ai donc expliqué les bugs et demandé de refaire une autre version:

Voici la deuxième version, qui fonctionnait:


Listen to Tommy
Listen to Gina
Listen to Vince
Cast Tommy
Cast Gina
Cast Vince

Put Gina times Gina into Delta
Put Tommy times Vince into Sue
Put Sue times 4 into Sue
Put Delta minus Sue into Delta
Put Tommy times 2 into Twoa
Put 0 minus Gina into Negb

If Tommy is 0
Say "a vaut 0 : ce n'est pas une equation du second degre"

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is 0
Put Negb over Twoa into Root
Say Root

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is less than 0
Say "Delta negatif : pas de solution reelle"

If Tommy is not 0 and Delta is greater than 0
Put Delta into Guess
Put 0 into Count
While Count is less than 40
Put Delta over Guess into Quot
Put Guess plus Quot into Guess
Put Guess over 2 into Guess
Build Count up

Put Negb plus Guess into Numa
Put Numa over Twoa into First
Put Negb minus Guess into Numa
Put Numa over Twoa into Second
Say First
Say Second


